==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|constrictus|notext=1}}, from the prefix {{m|la|con-||with}} + {{m|la|strictus}}, past participle of {{m|la|stringere}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/kənˈstɹɪkt/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɪkt|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To [[narrow]], especially by applying [[pressure]].

